&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5auXYcDWVUoQ7kNvwH1D9-H&_nc_oc=Adpp2CKEa7-ZbiKBu3qF-PwKXssB3Qf8MRZO0U-7ofnWV_0bM77BOEdpm_TcLT9_OnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af35bjIgijtJ3vfYibT-pEc10sRPA6QHtthQkaevVxw8dQ&oe=69EA2030"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hero Cover - Landscape.png", "id": "987485880607853", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301053_987485883941186_5506142798775602524_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=osOl_iXN6vkQ7kNvwEjErMp&_nc_oc=Ado9orZCuYnz7z61WfCRE5i5ZRjEvuqF5HaSzYqXILe-QuaknKdk1bnwRn7IAKK8StY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0VMJOiyFnvWizcGiiDG5CtpOtf8Ya3f3LqNGiuRlUPEw&oe=69EA20DC"}, "display_name": "Sign'n'Sync", "keywords": ["handtracking", "mixedreality", "rhythm", "music", "controllerfree"], "long_description": "Experience the next evolution of **Quest Hand Tracking**. Sign\u2019n\u2019Sync is a high-energy rhythm experience where your hands are the controller. Forget the buttons\u2014use 4 intuitive hand signs to interact with a digital world that glitches, pulses, and dissolves to the beat.\n\n### **CURRENT FEATURES**\n\n*   **Pure Hand Tracking:** Built from the ground up for a controller-free experience.\n    \n*   **Glitch-Dissolve Aesthetic:** Watch the environment react to your performance with unique real-time shaders.\n    \n*   **Two High-Energy Tracks:** Glitch-Pop Energy & Afro-Electronic Groove.\n        \n*   **Studio Mode:** Perfect for seated or standing play in any environment.\n    \n\n### **HOW TO PLAY**\n\nAs the rhythmic gates approach, match the 4 specific hand signs to the beat. Precision is key\u2014the better your timing, higher the score.\n\n### **ROADMAP**\n\nSign\u2019n\u2019Sync is a living project. We are starting with our core \"Studio Mode\" to ensure the Hand Tracking feels perfect. Coming soon in future updates:\n\n*   **\"Sync me to da Club\":** Transform your actual room into a reactive venue using Spatial Data.\n    \n*   **Expanded Setlist:** More tracks ranging from Lo-Fi to Hardcore Electronic.\n    \n*   **Complex Signs:** New gestures to master as the BPM rises.\n    \n\n**Sync up. Sign on. Start the beat.**", "short_description": "Sync your hands. Master the rhythm. Welcome to Sign\u2019n\u2019Sync. Experience the next level of Quest hand-tracking with a unique glitch-dissolve aesthetic. \n\nUse 4 intuitive signs to interact with a digital landscape that pulses to the beat of high-energy electronic tracks. Launching with two energetic launch tracks (128 & 140 BPM). \n\nController-free, immersive, and built for the flow. More tracks and 'Club Mode' coming soon!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/signsync-privacypolicy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Love", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/digital-love-landing-page/contact-us", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26386454154327391"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2976836359155417"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2976836359155417"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1775672580,